---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="About | Baitaan Tools" description="Who builds Baitaan Tools.">
  <article class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900">About</h1>
    <p>Baitaan Tools is built by MAAF Studios, a web development studio based in Pakistan. We make free calculators and everyday tools in Spanish, Portuguese and Arabic.</p>
    <p>Every tool runs in your browser, cites its official source and shows when it was last updated. Labour and tax calculators are reviewed every January when new rates are published.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
